    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/7e25432fc1c59f9830400ab882116bad.avif?t=1755100293\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Violent &amp; Progressive Combat:</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give enemies a high five to happily banish them, throw frisbees, and unlock many more to progress through Hymble\u2019s world.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/fc4f92c3b104f13981af8ef129fd0b3f.poster.avif?t=1755100293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/fc4f92c3b104f13981af8ef129fd0b3f.webm?t=1755100293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/fc4f92c3b104f13981af8ef129fd0b3f.mp4?t=1755100293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/ccd48d8307fe533260f43419dee1f58b.avif?t=1755100293\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/0aac95f94f19c9d73514891039adb69e.avif?t=1755100293\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abundant Collectables:</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather ingredients and pink coins as many times as you like, to craft health restoring smoothies and unlock cool items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/0102e622898637ac78c768161cdc7d33.avif?t=1755100293\" /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humour: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light-hearted and silly; A nod to Saturday morning cartoons like Spongebob.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/2e7f48cb85fb59c23c051553c8367f69.avif?t=1755100293\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compelling Story: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hymble and Codee are in pursuit of friendship, acceptance and self-discovery.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/955d494b35c37ea6332a212c5493e676.avif?t=1755100293\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisation: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress Hymble in \u2018damage resistant\u2019 accessories, or Codee with silly hats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/34d08b57b746c9e6d887da9b8f860d13.poster.avif?t=1755100293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/34d08b57b746c9e6d887da9b8f860d13.webm?t=1755100293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/34d08b57b746c9e6d887da9b8f860d13.mp4?t=1755100293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/7e25432fc1c59f9830400ab882116bad.avif?t=1755100293\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Violent &amp; Progressive Combat:</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give enemies a high five to happily banish them, throw frisbees, and unlock many more to progress through Hymble\u2019s world.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/fc4f92c3b104f13981af8ef129fd0b3f.poster.avif?t=1755100293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/fc4f92c3b104f13981af8ef129fd0b3f.webm?t=1755100293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/fc4f92c3b104f13981af8ef129fd0b3f.mp4?t=1755100293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/ccd48d8307fe533260f43419dee1f58b.avif?t=1755100293\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/0aac95f94f19c9d73514891039adb69e.avif?t=1755100293\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abundant Collectables:</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather ingredients and pink coins as many times as you like, to craft health restoring smoothies and unlock cool items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/0102e622898637ac78c768161cdc7d33.avif?t=1755100293\" /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humour: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light-hearted and silly; A nod to Saturday morning cartoons like Spongebob.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/2e7f48cb85fb59c23c051553c8367f69.avif?t=1755100293\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compelling Story: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hymble and Codee are in pursuit of friendship, acceptance and self-discovery.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/955d494b35c37ea6332a212c5493e676.avif?t=1755100293\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisation: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress Hymble in \u2018damage resistant\u2019 accessories, or Codee with silly hats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/34d08b57b746c9e6d887da9b8f860d13.poster.avif?t=1755100293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/34d08b57b746c9e6d887da9b8f860d13.webm?t=1755100293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419200/extras/34d08b57b746c9e6d887da9b8f860d13.mp4?t=1755100293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>",
    "short_description": "A cute, quirky level-based adventure where you relive the classic era of collectathon platformers with a modern twist. Explore whimsical worlds, meet charming characters and unlock new abilities as you progress through a diverse set of puzzles, obstacles and denizens.",
